rawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんかっこ良かった！\n泣き顔も可愛いよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、スカイウォークをしてくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん  いくちゃん  かずみん...日村さんも凄い怖かったのに頑張っててカッコ良かった〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカオタワー登ったときは\nもう地球まるごと見えてるんじゃないかと思うくらい高くて......ほんとヤバかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんお疲れさま......ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななつん卒業なんだね...おめでとう！って言わないとね...\n短い間だったけど沢山の思い出を一緒につくることが出来ました！\nこれからも夢に向かって頑張って\nまあやも頑張るから\np(^-^)q\n私達の事忘れないでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は久しぶりのoffでひなちまと\n渋谷、原宿で遊びました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見かけて声かけてくださった方ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問に沢山の方が答えてくれてありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牡蠣が苦手な方もいましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国にはまだ食べた事ないし、聞いた事もない美味しい食べ物が沢山あるんだね〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！乃木坂でも行かせてもらったけど、\n小さい時に家族で２回位 北海道に行った事あって、その時に食べた蟹やウニや、イクラ等々凄く美味しいかったです(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業式を迎えた方へ\nおめでとうございますm(__)m\n新しい生活が始まるね♪\nドキドキや不安があると思うけど\n応援します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも４月から高校生！\n一緒に頑張る！p(^-^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオ初披露の『気づいたら片想い』どうでしたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21356":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんにちは～！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です\n \n 早く学校着きすぎちゃって安定の図書館なうです(・ω・)(笑)\n いつも全然人いないのに今日は人が多いなあなんでだろう！\n \n \n 最近は普段巻き髪かストレートだけで、アレンジはしてなかったんですが、\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYRCB412V557Y1MDP8DV0G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n ↑頑張って見せようとしてるとしちゃん。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYRDBAQ19HGS4X8FPHTPG8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 結局あんまり見えないですね(；ω；)\n 久々に髪の毛編み込んでハーフアップ？にしてみました～～\n \n ちっちゃい頃からヘアアレンジするのが大好きで、リカちゃん人形で三つ編みとか編み込みとか練習してました(笑)\n 小学生の頃から下手っぴだったけど自分で髪の毛を巻いたりしてて、中学生の頃たくさん雑誌とか見て色んな巻き方の練習してました！\n \n なので巻いたり編み込みとか得意です♪\n ヘアアレンジちょっと得意です！(笑)\n \n 意外でしょ☆\n \n \n 学校終わりにお母さんとショッピングしました☆\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYREBFEHE12D7RVD8SKEVD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 悩んでるとしちゃん。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYRFAHSGT3YCKH7DDQDK0V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n エスカレーターとしちゃん。\n \n あ！この日着ていたピンクのライダースジャケットすっごくお気に入りなんですうう！\n ライダースジャケット自体が好きなのもありますが、もうすっっごく丁度好きな感じのダスティーなピンクで、かなりお気に入りです☆\n \n あ！リッュクに付いてるの気になりましたか？？！(笑)\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYRGAFS3P61W264FRJPE9H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n じゃん！可愛いでしょ～～♪\n フワフワのハートのチャーム？です！\n この日にPLAZAで発見してゲットしてすぐ付けました！(・ω・)\n ダスティーピンクでフワフワで凄いお気に入りです☆\n \n なんかお気に入りのものばっかり紹介しちゃった(笑)\n \n またお気に入りのものあったら書きますね♪\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYRHEYBA12C9GVF5EM6JA9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n ばいばい！\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}